PROJECT 1B


Jacob Garcia - jacobgar

Description: This project implements several system calls for tracking and managing process behavior and system statistics in a kernel based operating system. These system calls include functionality for retrieving trap and interrupt history, system call statistics, and process management features like getting child process IDs. 

